                                        "entry_id": "568b0b20-263b-3049-a517-279867573042",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The quality of being scriptural; scripturality."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "38b6393c-66fc-4407-bc41-6c7e3b85d302",
                                                "sense_id": "2d2f9d74-2762-323c-abea-95b9cd68f459",
                                                "text": "And, of course, it is not startling news that the Zwickau prophets had questioned the scripturalness of the practice as early as 1521."
